-- This does not fetch providers or seed a fresh catalog. It creates the 12 series FK
-- targets, then replaces only existing computed/legacy occurrences for 2026..2041.
-- A corrected proxy retains its immutable ID. If a separate computed event already
-- exists, its duplicate is retired and old URL aliases point to the computed event.

